Package: bsvarPost
Type: Package
Title: Post-Estimation Analysis for 'bsvars' and 'bsvarSIGNs'
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("David", "Zenz", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email = "office@davidzenz.com")
Description: Provides methods for the post-estimation analysis of Bayesian
    structural vector autoregressions estimated with the 'bsvars' and
    'bsvarSIGNs' packages. The package computes tabular posterior summaries of
    impulse responses, cumulative dynamic multipliers, forecast error variance
    decompositions, historical decompositions, structural shocks, and
    forecasts. It compares posterior quantities across model specifications,
    evaluates pointwise and joint posterior hypotheses, selects representative
    posterior draws, summarises response magnitudes and timing, and reports
    restriction and acceptance diagnostics for sign-restricted models.
    Functions for visualising and reporting posterior results complement these
    analyses.
